  <FremenTribes.label>弗雷曼人聚居地</FremenTribes.label>
  <!-- EN: These people have been here a very long time. Maybe their ancestors crashed here a thousand years ago. Maybe they survived some cataclysm that destroyed a technological civilization here. In any case, the tribals are mostly nomadic people who live off the land using primitive tools and weapons.\n\nSome tribes are more aggressive than others; many are open to trade and alliances, even with strange peoples like yourselves. Close cooperation or recruitment will be very difficult because of the vast sociotechnological and linguistic gap between the tribals and yourselves.\n\nDespite their apparent technological weakness, the tribals can be dangerous enemies and valuable friends because of their skill with low-tech warfare, their numbers, and their hardiness. -->
  <FremenTribes.description>这些人已经在这里生活了很长时间。也许他们的祖先在一千年前坠毁于此。也许他们幸存于某场摧毁了当地技术文明的大灾变。无论如何，这些部落居民大多是游牧民族，他们使用原始的工具和武器，依靠土地生活。

有些部落比其他部落更具攻击性；许多部落则乐于进行贸易和结盟，甚至愿意与像你们这样的陌生族群打交道。由于部落与你们之间存在巨大的社会技术及语言鸿沟，要与他们建立密切合作或招募他们将非常困难。

尽管在技术上看似薄弱，但凭借其在低技术战争中的娴熟技巧、庞大的族群规模以及顽强的生存能力，这些部落既可能成为危险的敌人，也可能成为宝贵的盟友。</FremenTribes.description>
